---
const stats = [
  { value: "XX", label: "Years of Celebration" },
  { value: "XXX+", label: "Families Involved" },
  { value: "X", label: "Days of Festivities" },
];
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase" style="color: var(--palette-gold);">
      Our Story
    </p>
    <h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl sm:text-4xl" style="color: var(--palette-crimson);">
      About Shriram Samruddhi Durga Pujo
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg" style="color: var(--muted-foreground);">
      Twenty years ago, a beautiful journey began when a group of people, strangers to
      one another and newly settled in their homes, came together within just two months
      to organise our very first Durga Puja. What began as a simple celebration soon
      blossomed into a cherished tradition and a bond that grew stronger with every
      passing year. Over time, neighbours became friends, friends became family, and our
      community became one big, loving family united by the spirit of Maa Durga. Today,
      Durga Puja is not just an annual celebration—it is a homecoming we eagerly await
      each year, a time to rejoice, reconnect, and create memories together.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
    {stats.map(({ value, label }) => (
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl" style="color: var(--palette-crimson); font-family: var(--font-heading);">
          {value}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm" style="color: var(--muted-foreground);">
          {label}
        </p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
